        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Amin, Dusty Dvoracek\n- Organizations: Chicago Bears, National Football League, Omaha Nighthawks, United Football League, Oklahoma\n- Events: 2006 NFL Draft\n- Programs: ESPN College Football Friday Primetime\n\nFacts:\n- Dusty Dvoracek played college football at Oklahoma.\n- In 2006, the Chicago Bears of the National Football League drafted Dusty Dvoracek in the third round of the 2006 NFL Draft.\n- From 2006 to 2009, Dusty Dvoracek played professionally with the Chicago Bears.\n- From 2010 to 2011, Dusty Dvoracek played professionally with the Omaha Nighthawks of the United Football League.\n- In 2017, ESPN College Football Friday Primetime games were to be announced by Adam Amin and Dusty Dvoracek.",
